/// `RN53(RN64(1.0 / x))` — one x87 `FDIV` at PC=64 then a `binary64` store: the
/// double-rounded reciprocal Excel uses to stage `POWER(x, y)` for `y < 0`
/// (compute the positive power, store it, then reciprocate).
